Interactability_Text_Line_2 Community Residents Complain About State Neglect
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Reports paint a dire picture of the living situation for people of slum communities as more affluent areas of Rio are cordoned off to control the spread of the disease. Local government officials have refused to comment on the matter.